# LOST LINKS: the swing, by real presses. The d-pad swings the aim towards
# the way pressed (a tap is one notch of 64, held it speeds up). Holding A
# charges: the power runs up and down twelve pips, slower the longer it is
# held; letting go hits. B cancels a swing; B held looks around.
game lostlinks
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat no_slicers
cheat ball 0 60 47
wait 2
expect aim == 0
# a tap is one notch
press DOWN 1
expect aim == 1
# held, it swings on round to the way pressed and stops there
hold DOWN 40
expect aim == 16
hold LEFT 60
expect aim == 32
hold RIGHT UP 30
expect aim == 56
hold RIGHT 80
expect aim == 0
# charging: up...
hold A 22
expect charging == 1
expect level == 6
# ...B cancels, no stroke spent
press B 1
expect charging == 0
expect strokes == 20
# the power turns at the top and comes back down, more slowly
hold A 44
expect level == 12
press B 1
hold A 60
expect level == 9
press B 1
hold A 80
expect level == 5
press B 1
expect strokes == 20
# a real stroke: one from the budget, and the ball rolls
hold A 22
wait 1
expect strokes == 19
expect moving == 1
waituntil moving == 0 600
expect strokes == 19
# B held looks around; the pad moves the view, not the aim
hold B RIGHT 40
expect panning == 1
expect pan_x > 60
expect aim == 0
wait 2
expect panning == 0
